<WORKFLOWS_TABLE>

### Workflow duplicates

If multiple workflow files describe the same pipeline, use this resolution framework:

1. List all candidate files.
2. Score each file by recency, completeness, and deprecation status.
3. Select one canonical file and move it to `.ssot/agents/entrypoints/`.
4. Register it in `.ssot/agents/workflows.json` with an allowed `category` (`onboarding`, `delivery`, `maintenance`, `session`). Ensure the `description` matches the entrypoint YAML frontmatter exactly.
5. Archive the rejected files under `.ssot.legacy/archived-workflows/` or delete them after user approval.
6. Record the decision in `.ssot/decisions.md`.

